{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34105","headline":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平上声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平上声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沟渠通疎荷，浦屿隐浅筱。\n舟闲攒轻苹，桨动起静鸟。\n阴稀余桑闲，缕尽晚茧小。\n吾徒当斯时，此道可以了。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}